0..70 Comment "// Codes `Eq.generic` reads but derives no equality from yet. `List`\'s"
71..149 Comment "// code is `1` for `Nil` and `field(a) × var List` for `Cons`: the leaf reads"
150..226 Comment "// the parameter, whose equality the derivation would need supplied. A `rec`"
227..304 Comment "// block\'s pair reads as two codes of one sort each, each naming the other in"
305..373 Comment "// a leaf rather than as a `var`, so the pair is a cycle through two"
374..453 Comment "// declarations, not one recursion; it needs a code of two sorts and one mutual"
454..474 Comment "// fixpoint over it."
475..477 Comment "//"
478..516 Comment "// - see: #2345 — `eqList`, `eqEven`"
